      "simplified": "小明的妈妈得了驾照，小明的爸爸说：“老婆，走！我带你去看车吧。”",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽得了駕照，小明的爸爸說：“老婆，走！我帶你去看車吧。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma dé le jià zhào xiǎo míng de bà ba shuō lǎo po zǒu wǒ dài nǐ qù kàn chē ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's mother got a driver's license, so Little Ming's father said: “Let's go, my wife! I'll take you looking at cars.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈非常高兴，和小明的爸爸去看车了。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽非常高興，和小明的爸爸去看車了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma fēi cháng gāo xìng hé xiǎo míng de bà ba qù kàn chē le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸带着她去了宝马、奔驰、保时捷等各种好车的专卖店。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸帶著她去了寶馬、奔馳、保時捷等各種好車的專賣店。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba dài zhe tā qù le bǎo mǎ bēn chí bǎo shí jié děng gè zhǒng hǎo chē de zhuān mài diàn",
      "english": "Little Ming's mother was very excited, and went to look at cars with the father."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's father took her to a speciality store for BMW, Benz, Porsche, and all kinds of good cars."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈更高兴了，心想：我的老公太好了！",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽更高興了，心想：我的老公太好了！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma gèng gāo xìng le xīn xiǎng wǒ de lǎo gōng tài hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's mother got even more excited, and thought to herself: “I have the best husband!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "从专卖店出来后，小明的爸爸说：“老婆，看好这些车了吧。",
      "traditional": "從專賣店出來後，小明的爸爸說：“老婆，看好這些車了吧。",
      "pinyin": "cóng zhuān mài diàn chū lái hòu xiǎo míng de bà ba shuō lǎo po kàn hǎo zhè xiē chē le ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "以后这些车你都别撞啊，我们赔不起啊！”",
      "traditional": "以後這些車你都別撞啊，我們賠不起啊！”",
      "pinyin": "yǐ hòu zhè xiē chē nǐ dōu bié zhuàng a wǒ men péi bù qǐ a",
      "english": "After leaving the specialty store, Little Ming's father said: “My wife, did you take a good look at these cars?”"
    }
